.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
.Dd November 3, 2026
.Dt MK.DOCS.MK 5
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm mk.docs.mk
.Nd API documentation with Doxygen
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Cm docs
target documents a framework's public headers with
.Xr doxygen 1 .
Links to other frameworks use tag files: from a framework, those already
generated; from a workspace, all, because it goes in
.Va PREREQS
order.
.Pp
Not included directly by a makefile.
.Ss Variables
Set in a
.Pa pre.mk
hook file, since this file reads them when it is included.
.Bl -tag -width "DOC_WARN_IF_UNDOCUMENTED"
.It Va DOXYGEN
The program.
Default
.Pa doxygen .
.It Va DOCS
.Cm no
leaves this framework out.
Default
.Cm yes .
.It Va DOCS_DIR
Output directory.
Default
.Pa docs .
.It Va DOC_PROJECT_NAME
Default: the directory's name.
.It Va DOC_PROJECT_VERSION
Default: the first line of the workspace's
.Pa VERSION .
.It Va DOC_PROJECT_BRIEF
A one-line description.
.It Va DOC_LOGO
Default:
.Pa docs/logo.png
or
.Pa .svg ,
here then in the workspace.
.It Va DOC_LICENSE_NOTICE
Default: the first line of the workspace's
.Pa LICENSE .
.It Va DOC_INPUT_EXTRA
More directories to read, relative to the framework.
A framework with no
.Pa include/
but this is documented.
.It Va DOC_FILE_PATTERNS
Which files in those.
.It Va DOC_WARN_IF_UNDOCUMENTED , Va DOC_EXTRACT_PRIVATE
.Cm YES
or
.Cm NO ,
the default, passed to Doxygen.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width "docs/framework.tag"
.It Pa docs/Doxyfile
generated
.It Pa docs/html/
the output
.It Pa docs/ Ns Ar framework Ns Pa .tag
what other frameworks link through
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
In
.Pa mk/pre.mk :
.Bd -literal -offset indent
DOC_PROJECT_NAME=Geo Toolkit
DOC_PROJECT_BRIEF=Raster and vector primitives
DOC_INPUT_EXTRA=src/api
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr doxygen 1 ,
.Xr mk.framework.mk 5 ,
.Xr mk.local.mk 5 ,
.Xr mk.workspace.mk 5 ,
.Xr bmake-it 7
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Sylvain Souche
